<title>HONG KONG: Bank of China launches US$200 mln five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Bank of China launches US$200 mln five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by lead manager Daiwa Securities (HK).</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANK OF CHINA</p>
<p> AMOUNT     US$200 MLN COUPON     L+30BP    MATURITY  5 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	  ISS PRICE  99.95     RE-OFFER  99.95</p>
<p> PUTS	 NONE	 CALLS	NONE	LAUNCH    18.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING    SINGAPORE  REPAYMENT  BULLET    REPLIES   --</p>
<p> RATING     --	   SALES LMTS CUSTOMARY</p>
<p> DENOMS     $1K/10K/100K/250K</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH    HOME CTRY  CHINA     PAY DATE  27.JUN.97</p>
<p> FEES	 25BP SPLIT MGT/UND    15BP	SELLING   10BP</p>
<p> JOINT LEAD MANAGERS   Daiwa Securities (HK), Bank of China</p>
<p>			     International and OCBC Bank</p>
<p> NOTES    ISIN CODE XS0077471281, COMMON CODE 7747128</p>
<p>	    *PRICED TO YIELD LIBOR+31BP</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960  http://www.hk97.com</p>
</text>
